Spec: Ride stats

Purpose:
  Duration, distance, top speed and average speed of one saved ride, exactly as the original app computed them.

Owns:
  ./ride_stats.dart
  /test/domain/ride_stats_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/04-domain.md

Must:
  `durationMs` is `endTime - startTime` when both are set, else `0`.
  `distanceMetres` is the sum of distances between consecutive trackpoints.
  `maxSpeedKmh` is the largest non-null trackpoint speed times `3.6`, else `0`.
  `avgSpeedKmh` is km divided by hours of duration, and `0` without a duration.

Scenario: ride without an end time
  Given a ride with a start time and no end time
  When its stats are computed
  Then duration and average speed are `0`

Example:
  no trackpoints: distance `0`
  one trackpoint: distance `0`
